  author: Infusion
  description: "Did this somehow end up from one of the doors in the factory to one
    of its explosive creations?\r\n\nEnter the correct code to unlock the module given
    by edgework. Denied access may have consequences.\n\nI tried making a module that
    wasn't based on another module in some way, and this is what I came up with.\n\nManual
    can be found at ktane.timwi.de or in the bundled manuals folder.\nSource code
    is at https://github.com/Infusion478/KTANE-Factory-Keypad\n\nComes with Twitch
    Plays support."
